 accelerates purchase timelines and spending. Despite strong growth potential, the industry faces challenges including regulatory hurdles, privacy concerns, and supply chain bottlenecks, especially for batteries and sensors. Analysts say the sector remains a balancing act, but seven specific drone stocks are currently positioned to prosper as both commercial and defense applications expand into late 2025."}],"$L13","$L14"]}]}],"$L15"]}]]}]}],"$L16"]}]}]]
